            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Factor the surface-area equation and retain the positive root.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2(x^2+5x+5x)&=78\\\\x^2+10x&=39\\\\x^2+10x-39&=0\\\\(x+13)(x-3)&=0\\\\x&=-13\\text{ or }3\\end{align*}$$\nSince $x>0$, $x=3$. The unknown dimension is $3\\text{ cm}$.",
